pipeline (<span class="mono">src/</span>) comprises the attack
(<span class="mono">attacks/gradient_inversion.py</span>), the gradient defences
(<span class="mono">defenses/gradient_defenses.py</span>), the defence sweep,
batch reconstruction, and the membership-inference attack, orchestrated by
<span class="mono">run_all.py</span>.</p>

