<h3>5.2&nbsp;&nbsp;Membership inference and the DP audit</h3>
<p>LiRA trains shadow models to calibrate a per-example likelihood-ratio test.
Following Carlini et&nbsp;al. (2022), we report the true-positive rate at low
false-positive rate &mdash; the metric that reflects whether <i>any</i> individual
can be confidently identified &mdash; not merely balanced accuracy. DP-SGD is
expected to flatten the attack toward chance.</p>
