<h3>5.3&nbsp;&nbsp;Batch reconstruction</h3>
<p>Extending the attack from one image to a batch shares the averaged gradient
across samples, making the inversion harder. We recover labels analytically
(batch iDLG) and jointly optimise all images.</p>
